#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "OpenDocument tekst: CV ili pismo preuzeto kao .odt fajl, i tekst .odt fajla koji otpremite, sačuvan da bi ga pretraga mogla pronaći. Kad je isključeno, preuzimanje se ne nudi i tekst otpremljenog fajla se ne čita."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Lokacije kompanija kao GeoJSON fajl za izvoz, i uvoz tačaka koje ručno smještaju adresu kompanije kad ih označite. Potrebne su Mape. Kad je isključeno, ništa od toga se ne nudi, a njihove adrese odgovaraju kao da tamo nema ničega."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "Formati fajlova koje Postulo može da čita i piše pored sopstvenog: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard i Europass. Ovo je prekidač za sve njih odjednom; svaki se i dalje može isključiti zasebno dok je ovo uključeno, osim PDF-a. Kad je isključeno, ništa se ne nudi u tim formatima i ništa se ne briše: fajlovi koje imate i podaci od kojih su napravljeni ostaju."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "Format u kojem se prave CV i pismo: označen, tako da ga čitač ekrana može pročitati. Uvijek uključeno; Postulo nema ništa drugo što bi i dalje bio CV."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Word dokumenti: CV ili pismo preuzeto kao .docx fajl, i tekst .docx fajla koji otpremite, sačuvan da bi ga pretraga mogla pronaći. Kad je isključeno, preuzimanje se ne nudi i tekst otpremljenog fajla se ne čita."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "Vaš kalendar kao .ics fajlovi i fidovi, i uvoz kalendarskog fajla. Kad je isključeno, preuzimanja, uvoz i fidovi se ne nude, a njihove adrese odgovaraju kao da tamo nema ničega; ponovo odgovaraju, na istoj adresi, kad se uključi."
